---
import Main from "../../layouts/Main.astro";
import PageHeader from "../../components/PageHeader.astro";
---

<Main title="Indigenous Data Sovereignty - Aurora Nyxus" description="On-prem AI where data stays in community custody. Physical control, OCAP-aligned governance.">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Indigenous data"
    title="Data that stays in the community's hands"
    lede="When secure means the box is under your physical control, we deploy on-prem systems where custody is the assurance."
    accent="violet"
    bgSrc="/images/hardware/hero-bg-mesh.webp"
    bgAlt="Meshed nodes for community-custody compute"
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink sm:text-3xl">Custody is the assurance</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
          For data sovereignty, security has a physical definition: the hardware
          is in the community's control. We deploy so the box lives where you
          decide, with safeguards set at the physical layer.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink sm:text-3xl">Governance-aligned</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
          Deployments respect data-sovereignty principles and OCAP-aligned
          governance: ownership, control, access, and possession stay with the
          community. Attribution is protected.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="grid gap-px border border-hairline bg-hairline sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="bg-canvas p-7 sm:p-8">
        <p class="mono-label mb-3 text-aurora-green">01</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-ink">Physical custody</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite">The box lives with you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-canvas p-7 sm:p-8">
        <p class="mono-label mb-3 text-signal">02</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-ink">OCAP-aligned</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite">Ownership, control, access, possession stay with the community.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-canvas p-7 sm:p-8">
        <p class="mono-label mb-3 text-aurora-violet">03</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-ink">Attribution protected</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite">Knowledge stays attributed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-24 pt-8 sm:pb-32">
    <a href="/contact" class="inline-block rounded-sm border border-aurora-violet/50 bg-aurora-violet/10 px-6 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-medium text-aurora-violet transition-colors hover:bg-aurora-violet/20">Start a conversation</a>
  </section>
</Main>
